OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA breezy day today with a
OL,6,Fmixture of cloud and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers. Showers will be most frequent
OL,8,Fin the north and west, with the best
OL,9,Fof the brightness towards the
OL,10,Fsoutheast. Mild for all.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,13,Fclear spells, though a few showers in
OL,14,Fthe west. Mist and fog developing
OL,15,Facross central and southern England,
OL,16,Fwhere it will also turn chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
