OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA mainly dry day with a mix
OL,6,Fof cloud and sunny spells, after the
OL,7,Fclearance of morning fog and low cloud
OL,8,Ffrom southern and central England.
OL,9,FTemperatures near average.
